WEBVTT

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:32.326
That didn't include any,
like, planning, or I don't know,

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:34.966
I probably can't even count
the hours that I spent,

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:38.456
the Saturdays and Sundays, grading papers.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:39.954
It was tough.

00:08:39.978 --> 00:08:45.506
AG: She estimates she was putting in
close to 100 hours a week -- 100!

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.436
CC: It was bananas.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.388
The most difficult thing

00:08:49.412 --> 00:08:54.346
was kind of this feeling of,
like, being trapped in this system

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:56.556
where you're on, like, a hamster wheel.

00:08:56.580 --> 00:09:01.476
You're kind of, like,
doing a lot and trying really hard,